  "details": "Earlier today i got messages about the instance i've been in for a couple of days to be closed. Before that happened by itself i created a new one and joined it:\n\n```\n\n2025.06.18 12:51:55 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerJoined ShingenPizza (usr_62c91c3c-8311-4024-9ce2-ecd6bc8183d1)\n\n```\n\nNow some hours later i find out that this new instance has already been closed and i was forcefully rejoined (instance id is the same according to logs).\n\n```\n\n2025.06.18 20:54:26 Error      -  Got DisconnectMessage. Code: 104 Msg: \"Instance closed\". Debug Info: {}\n\n```\n\nI believe instances are supposed to be closed automatically after a week, not after 8 hours.\n\nPrevious cases of \"instance closed\":\n\n```\n\n2025.06.02 12:14:58 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerJoined ShingenPizza (usr_62c91c3c-8311-4024-9ce2-ecd6bc8183d1) <- when i started VRC and joined the initial instance\n\n2025.06.04 09:00:25 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerJoined ShingenPizza (usr_62c91c3c-8311-4024-9ce2-ecd6bc8183d1) <- manual new instance, idk if it was because of a warning or i just did it to make instance live longer - it didn't work out very well\n\n2025.06.05 09:29:11 Error      -  Got DisconnectMessage. Code: 104 Msg: \"Instance closed\". Debug Info: {}\n\n2025.06.06 07:53:32 Error      -  Got DisconnectMessage. Code: 104 Msg: \"Instance closed\". Debug Info: {}\n\n2025.06.10 12:42:14 Error      -  Got DisconnectMessage. Code: 104 Msg: \"Instance closed\". Debug Info: {}\n\n2025.06.13 04:43:11 Error      -  Got DisconnectMessage. Code: 104 Msg: \"Instance closed\". Debug Info: {}\n\n```\n\nbuild probably doesn't matter as it's server-side, but whichever was live on 2025-06-02, i think it was 1629",
